      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `752e37c0c6b0b1ecc6a2ad644f4fa4aec0cdacca18d04cb95ff0fbccdb5d1035--4515DC002_201112.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Federal Defendants, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2011-12\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | b7a24c7056627f8629bfccec1fb03cadb0fb87d9e7784f8f86cb95ff66ef60a9 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | a3aacdc64a128ddc15fd74cc263dc4b05e51f86eccea58c12928a9f93b538461 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | f6616a423a950c0f3535ec405d14df774d7b790256e51cb565987f871304d0c1 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | f48853d314f22a4a07dae569d41b4fe602d60a2caf014478f088c4612fc1ed74 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | dcea8631126f464d72f8a0530dc9e94371f6c7d9b9d26d05da51e5b3745c9ad7 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 00c86384f7457598963dc7de094d22902148191eff7bb8c5048dec371bda5e96 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | abf61a84271f18422a8f596e016ee832d1be51fb52b830aa9b226b8222daacd0 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 107b494d10c1760624a90b677b8478ac4733012c3b05cef70b623ca2c4bca484 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 748551bf5fb24328944a94bff9a0bb56853049140c39f23cf15e6d6e5a04769b | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
